{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q413184","formula":"C₁₇H₁₇ClN₆O₃","hill":"C17H17ClN6O3","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl"],"composition":{"C":17.0,"H":17.0,"N":6.0,"O":3.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Eszopiclone","ru":"Эсзопиклон"},"descriptions":{"en":"Eszopiclone, sold under the brand name Lunesta among others, is a nonbenzodiazepine medication used in the treatment of short-term and long-term insomnia. It is one of the few FDA-approved hypnotic medications with a controlled substance designation that does not have restrictions on its length of use. Evidence supports benefits up to six months, with some studies suggesting similar efficacy after 12 months.","ru":"Эсзопиклон, продаваемый под торговой маркой Лунеста и другими, — препарат, который применяют для лечения бессонницы. Имеющиеся данные подтверждают незначительную или умеренную пользу в течение шести месяцев. Препарат принимают внутрь перорально."},"fame":19,"pubchemCid":969472,"mass":388.8,"charge":0,"smiles":"CN1CCN(CC1)C(=O)O[C@H]2C3=NC=CN=C3C(=O)N2C4=NC=C(C=C4)Cl","inchikey":"GBBSUAFBMRNDJC-INIZCTEOSA-N","iupac":"[(7S)-6-(5-chloro-2-pyridinyl)-5-oxo-7H-pyrrolo[3,4-b]pyrazin-7-yl] 4-methylpiperazine-1-carboxylate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"969472","atoms":44,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-6.191,"y":-2.977,"z":-0.166,"el":"Cl"},{"x":0.242,"y":-0.586,"z":0.629,"el":"O"},{"x":1.603,"y":-0.311,"z":2.445,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.251,"y":2.261,"z":-1.681,"el":"O"},{"x":2.388,"y":-1.419,"z":0.559,"el":"N"},{"x":4.617,"y":-2.117,"z":-1.091,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.667,"y":0.716,"z":0.032,"el":"N"},{"x":1.4,"y":2.205,"z":1.253,"el":"N"},{"x":0.17,"y":3.654,"z":-0.878,"el":"N"},{"x":-3.738,"y":0.072,"z":-0.911,"el":"N"},{"x":2.17,"y":-1.922,"z":-0.799,"el":"C"},{"x":3.662,"y":-1.799,"z":1.163,"el":"C"},{"x":3.